  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Kenyan horticultural sector data for lobby &amp; trade</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main goal of this project is to assist the three most important horticultural sector associations in Kenya. The project focuses on enhancing the usability and management of Kenian horticultural sector data. That enables these associations to enhance their data system, advocate for their sector, have an impact on policy decisions, and improve trade opportunities on an international level. Ultimately, this project plays a significant role in promoting better understanding, transparency, and appeal of the horticultural sector in Kenya. Additionally, it also strengthens the trade relationship between the Netherlands and Kenya in the field of horticulture.</narrative>
  </description>
